<title>USA: Cafe la France IPO withdrawn - underwriter.</title>
<headline>Cafe la France IPO withdrawn - underwriter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cafe la France Inc's initial public offering has been withdrawn, said underwriter Schneider Securities on Thursday.</p>
<p>Schneider declined to give a reason for the withdrawal.</p>
<p>The company was offering 1.15 million shares at an estimated price of $4.25 per share.</p>
<p>Cafe la France consists of a chain of 17 cafes, 11 of which are owned and operated by the company and six of which are operated as franchises.</p>
